    "sentences": [
      "Kaya, fourteen, thought about her trip to travel north.",
      "She dreamed of the aurora for important research.",
      "Wolves live wild there, and Kaya felt very brave.",
      "One rainy morning, the weather was bad, so her neighbor was absent.",
      "Kaya decided to boil water; she added coffee, no sugar.",
      "She quickly ate her meal, then she spent forty minutes studying.",
      "A popular actor would appear; he was forty years old.",
      "He gave a public concert, and Kaya wanted to photograph him.",
      "She felt tired but imagined being an interviewer.",
      "Finally, her mother called: “Let's go to the amusement park!”",
      "Kaya took off her uniform and turned off her computer.",
      "They would arrive soon, and during the trip, she was happy."
